{
    "test_name": "MOB.390_Work_Add_Condition",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.390_Work_Add_Condition",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.390` **Add a condition score \u2014 proved after a reload \u2014 then delete it again.**\n- Cascading lookups: asset -> inspection group -> inspection element (order is load-bearing);\n  \"Inspection Group\" is assetStandardDetailId and \"Condition Left\" is conditionScore.\n- Key `Pump 0102 \u00b7 Structural \u00b7 Pump Body` \u2014 NOT the fixture's own\n  `Mounting/Support` condition: the server keeps one per key and refused every repeat\n  (bugs \u00a740 \u2014 the modal still closed, so this test was green while adding nothing).\n- \u2b50 Proof after a RELOAD: exactly one card with the key and 1 / 2 / 3.\n- \ud83d\uded1 Self-cleaning with an **owner-sanctioned delete** (trap 2): `Delete Item` on that card\n  only \u2014 guarded in the same step as the gear click \u2014 then a reload proves it gone and the\n  original untouched.",
